                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJv-25mDirQjQRRgkQjMffEO4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGR1RXbEhUekZ6YmtkdVpHUm9UbUozVjNOVFdtYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  3,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "We ordered a spicy hot pot for two and shredded potatoes.\n\nPros: The broth was delicious, and the fried dough sticks were great after soaking up the soup. It would be even better if the contents included slices of meat.\n\nCons: The water cups and bowls in the self-service area all smelled like dishcloths, which was awful…we had to replace them several times…we suggest using clean cloths to wipe them down. The tofu in the soup was burnt.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "點了麻辣雙人鍋、土豆絲\n優點：鍋底好吃，油條吸湯後再吃也很讚，內容物可以含肉片更讚，\n缺點：自助區的水杯跟碗都有抹布的味道，實在太可怕…換了好幾個…建議用乾淨的布擦拭吧\n湯裡豆腐煮焦",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "CHANG JAMES",
                                                  "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103699164527675295796/reviews",
                                                  "photoUri":  "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJxkKW0vyrN9iU2C74s43tmtVm9ZkE4cUhCxASnCeSdSN1nfA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2"
                                              },
                        "publishTime":  "2026-03-06T03:06:32.802192838Z",
                        "flagContentUri":  "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGR1RXbEhUekZ6YmtkdVpHUm9UbUozVjNOVFdtYxAB\u0026d=17924085\u0026t=1",
                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGR1RXbEhUekZ6YmtkdVpHUm9UbUozVjNOVFdtYxAB!2m1!1s0x3442ab3898b9edbf:0xee10dfc78c100946"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJv-25mDirQjQRRgkQjMffEO4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psdU5qbHpWREpGYWxoUVdXMUZjM3AyZFVsMlIzYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "6 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The stir-fried pork balls were spicy and flavorful, and a serving of 10 was quite generous.\nThe Sichuan Mapo Tofu Rice was fragrant, spicy, and smooth, especially with the addition of fresh minced garlic, which elevated the flavor to another level. The minced pork had a slight porky taste, but the tofu was absolutely delicious. Perhaps a vegetarian version could be made in the future?\n\nThe stir-fried shredded potatoes with vinegar were simply delicious! 😆 The slow-cooked vegetable and chicken soup, made with sous-vide chicken, had a refreshing and delicious taste. The fact that you can substitute vegetables for the hot pot ingredients is fantastic.\n\nAnd another thing, which is actually my absolute favorite, is the use of ceramic pots, ceramic or iron spoons, and glass cups. It shows the restaurant\u0027s attention to detail.\n\nOne slight pity is the slight fermented oil smell in the restaurant; it would be perfect without it.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "炒手香辣夠味，一份有10顆，份量還挺足夠的\n巴蜀麻婆豆腐飯吃起來香辣順口，尤其又加了一些新鮮的蒜蓉在上面，整個味道又提升一個層次，絞肉有一點豬味，但豆腐是相當的好吃，也許之後可以有機會出素食版？\n醋溜土豆絲就是一個好吃的土豆絲😆\n老火蔬菜雞湯選了舒肥雞，整個是清爽好吃的口感，而且可以把火鍋料換成蔬菜，這一點真的相當棒\n還有一點，其實是我最喜歡最喜歡的，就是他用的餐具是陶瓷的鍋子、陶瓷或者鐵製的湯匙以及玻璃的杯子，看得出店家真的很用心\n有一點可惜的地方是，店裡面有一點點油發酵的味道，如果少了這個味道就太棒了",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
